    { "Key": "SOUND_Banks_Header", "Text": "Sound Banks" },
    { "Key": "SOUND_Banks_Header_Fmod_TT", "Text": "The game's FMOD sample banks (.fsb, and DS2's sound binders), grouped by name: c = characters, m = maps, o = objects, p/rm = music, v = voice, and so on.\nMusic banks of DS3 and Sekiro are encrypted; they are decrypted for reading." },
    { "Key": "SOUND_Banks_Header_Wwise_TT", "Text": "The game's Wwise sound banks (.bnk), grouped by name: cs = characters and maps, aeg = assets, s = system, vc = voice, and so on.\nBanks in a language folder (enus, ja) are marked; their streamed sounds come from that language's wems." },
    { "Key": "SOUND_Banks_None", "Text": "No sound banks were found in the file dictionary." },
    { "Key": "SOUND_Banks_Failed", "Text": "(failed)" },

